{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"1028001000310010","name":"はるき","text":"むむ……","trans":"唔唔……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"どうした？　はるき","trans":"怎么了？阳希","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000310020","name":"はるき","text":"実は今日、朝ごはん食べずに\r\n来てしまいまして……","trans":"其实今天，我没吃早饭\n就过来了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000310030","name":"はるき","text":"今頃になってお腹が……","trans":"现在肚子才开始……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000310040","name":"はるき","text":"いただいてもいいんですか……？","trans":"我可以吃吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000310050","name":"はるき","text":"ありがとうございます\r\n助かります～","trans":"谢谢您\n真是帮大忙了～","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000310060","name":"はるき","text":"そうですね、ちょっとだけ……","trans":"是呢，那就一点点……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"1028001000310070","name":"はるき","text":"でも、みんなが来てからがいいですよね……","trans":"不过，还是等大家来了再吃比较好呢……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}